        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ 6400 Series 30 - 36 Inch Door Commercial Exit Device</b>\r\n<p>The PDQ 6400 Series offers a heavy duty grade 1 solution for compliance with life safety and fire code requirements. They come with touch bar components that are constructed of heavy gauge wrought steel or stainless steel as well as metal chassis covers and end caps. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Features and Certifications </b>for PDQ 6400R Rim Exit Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Quiet operation - large heavy-duty spring cushion quiets both the\r\n compression/extension of the push bar</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Internal compression spring ensures long lasting push bar return</li>\r\n<li>Simple field door prep and installation</li>\r\n<li>True 2-3/4” backset (with 5/8” frame stop and 1/8” door gap)</li>\r\n<li>Wood and machine screws included with each device</li>\r\n<li>Warranty:  10 year limited manufacturer's warranty</li>\r\n<li> Listed for UL 305 “Panic”, listed for UL 10C “Fire Exit Hardware” up to 3 hours. </li>\r\n<li> Certified to ANSI/BHMA A156.3 Grade 1</li>\r\n<li> FL #40297 +60/-65 psf 4080 16ga Single</li>\r\n<li> FL #40297 +50/-50 psf 4080 18ga Single</li>\r\n<li> Complies with ADA (Americans with Disabilities Act) and ICC/ANSI 117.1 for Accessible\r\nand Usable Buildings</li>\r\n<li> Meets requirements of the Buy American Act as a COTS product manufactured in the United States</li></ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p><b>Specifications </b>for PDQ 6400R Rim Exit Device\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Chassis: Cadmium plated steel</li>\r\n<li>Rail: Heavy gauge steel or stainless steel</li>\r\n<li>Touch Pad: Heavy gauge steel or stainless steel</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: Stainless steel dead locking with 3/4\" throw rim</li>\r\n<li>Head Width: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Head Height: 8-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" extended, 2-1/2\" depressed</li>\r\n<li>Hand: Device is non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Dogging: Hex key dogging standard / No dogging on fire labeled devices</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: 2-1/8\" minimum</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"- 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Width: Standard for 2'6\"- 3'0\" door maximum</li>\r\n<li>Warranty:  10 year limited manufacturer's warranty</li>\r\n\r\n\r\n<li><B>Installation Instructions: </b> <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4200R-install.pdf?v=1704262226\" target=\"new\">Non Fire Rated (PDF)</a> - \r\n <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4200RF-install.pdf?v=1704262226\" target=\"new\">Fire Rated (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
